{
  "comment": "Deck sync scenarios (docs/DECK_SYNC.md), shared by the web, iOS and Android tests. Each case: the signed-in profile (`account`), the server's decks (`seq` is the change sequence; a fake server keeps the next one after the highest), this device's library (`revision` is the library's) and sync record (`sync`, null for none), then one sync. A deck's document is `{format: \"commander\", entries: [{cardName, quantity: 1, section: \"deck\"} for each of `cards`], source: {kind: \"manual\"}}`. Expected decks are compared by id (or `fork`: a new id this sync made) without order; afterwards no local deck is dirty and there are no tombstones.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a first sync sends this device's decks",
      "account": "A",
      "server": [],
      "local": [
        {
          "id": "L1",
          "name": "Atraxa",
          "revision": 1,
          "cards": [
            "Sol Ring"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sync": null,
      "expect": {
        "local": [
          {
            "id": "L1",
            "name": "Atraxa",
            "cards": [
              "Sol Ring"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "server": [
          {
            "id": "L1",
            "name": "Atraxa",
            "revision": 1,
            "deleted": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a deck made on another device arrives",
      "account": "A",
      "server": [
        {
          "id": "S1",
          "name": "Krenko",
          "revision": 1,
          "seq": 1,
          "deleted": false,
          "cards": [
            "Goblin Guide"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "local": [],
      "sync": {
        "account": "A",
        "cursor": 0,
        "entries": {},
        "tombstones": []
      },
      "expect": {
        "local": [
          {
            "id": "S1",
            "name": "Krenko",
            "cards": [
              "Goblin Guide"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "server": [
          {
            "id": "S1",
            "name": "Krenko",
            "revision": 1,
            "deleted": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "another device's edit replaces an unchanged deck",
      "account": "A",
      "server": [
        {
          "id": "S1",
          "name": "Krenko v2",
          "revision": 2,
          "seq": 2,
          "deleted": false,
          "cards": [
            "Goblin Guide",
            "Mountain"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "local": [
        {
          "id": "S1",
          "name": "Krenko",
          "revision": 1,
          "cards": [
            "Goblin Guide"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sync": {
        "account": "A",
        "cursor": 1,
        "entries": {
          "S1": {
            "serverRevision": 1,
            "syncedLocalRevision": 1
          }
        },
        "tombstones": []
      },
      "expect": {
        "local": [
          {
            "id": "S1",
            "name": "Krenko v2",
            "cards": [
              "Goblin Guide",
              "Mountain"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "server": [
          {
            "id": "S1",
            "name": "Krenko v2",
            "revision": 2,
            "deleted": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an edit here goes up on the revision it was based on",
      "account": "A",
      "server": [
        {
          "id": "S1",
          "name": "Krenko",
          "revision": 1,
          "seq": 1,
          "deleted": false,
          "cards": [
            "Goblin Guide"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "local": [
        {
          "id": "S1",
          "name": "Krenko mine",
          "revision": 2,
          "cards": [
            "Goblin Guide",
            "Mountain"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sync": {
        "account": "A",
        "cursor": 1,
        "entries": {
          "S1": {
            "serverRevision": 1,
            "syncedLocalRevision": 1
          }
        },
        "tombstones": []
      },
      "expect": {
        "local": [
          {
            "id": "S1",
            "name": "Krenko mine",
            "cards": [
              "Goblin Guide",
              "Mountain"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "server": [
          {
            "id": "S1",
            "name": "Krenko mine",
            "revision": 2,
            "deleted": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "both devices edited: the server's copy keeps the id, this device's edit becomes a copy",
      "account": "A",
      "server": [
        {
          "id": "S1",
          "name": "Theirs",
          "revision": 2,
          "seq": 2,
          "deleted": false,
          "cards": [
            "Forest"
